        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo sha pasaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho balī ng'witogolo lya Sinai mu ng'waka gwabo gwa kabīlī kūfuma kwīnga Misili, mu ng'weji gwa kwandya, ū SEEBA ūlūngalūnga nū Musa; ūng'wīla gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“A Baisilaeli ni bizūkagwe kūshiyegela ī shigukulu sha pasaka ū ng'wikanza īlo līhelilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakwandya ikanza lya mhīndī gīt'ūmo īhelelilwe, lūshikū lwa ikūmi na inè ng'weji gwenūyū. Pyī ī mihayo īshikīlījiwe gīt'ūmo shilagīlo shihayīlile, kūlenganīla na kaīle ka kahelele.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Musa ūbawīla a Baisilaeli kūshizūkwa ī shigukulu sha pasaka na kūshiyegela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana aho balī ū ng'witoglo lya Sinai, lwahayūshika ū lūshikū lw'ikūmi n'inè ū mu ng'weji gwa kwandya, a Baisilaeli būgwīta ū mhayo gwenūyo. Bīīta būlī mhayo gīt'ūmo SEEBA walī wanagīīlīla ū Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū lūshikū lwenūlo, bamò babo batīliile ī pasaka, baalī baasosohala kūlwa nguno ya mimba gwa munhū nebe. Na lūūlū biza ū kūlī Musa nū Alooni ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būshika būng'wīla ū Musa, “A bise tūlī na būsoso kūlwa nguno ya mimba gwa munhū, alīyo nahene nibūlī tūleke ū kūmfunīja ū SEEBA ī shakwinha hamò na a Baisilaeli a bangī ū ng'wikanza īlo līhelilwe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Musa ūbawīla, “Lindīīlagi kūshisha napandīke būtongeeji kūfuma kūlī SEEBA ū mu mihayo ying'we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma y'ikanza ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawīlage a Baisilaeli gīkī, “Ūlū ūmò wing'we nūūlū ūmò wa mu shibyalīlwe shing'we ūsosohala kūlwa nguno ya mimba, nūūlū ūbiza atīho nguno alī mu lūgendo, ū ng'wenūyo akūbiza ataalī azunīlīgije ū kwīyegela ī pasaka ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba gīko bakwīyegela ī pasaka mhīndī ya lūshikū lwa ikūmi na inè mu ng'weji gwa kabīlī. Hū ī likanza īlo bakwīlya ī ng'holo ya pasaka hamò nū ngatī ūyo gūtī na shibimbya, na makūbī malūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nyama yenīyo yaya ū kwīlekeela kūshisha ntondo yaho; hangī yaya kūbīnza iguha lyayo nūūlū līmò. Nabo shibigelilwe kwīlya ī pasaka kūlenganīla nī shilagīlo īsho shitūūlilwe ho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ūlū munhū atī na būsoso bose bose, nūūlū atī mu lūgendo, alīyo ūleka dūhū ū kūsangīla na a banhū a bangī ū kwīlya ī pasaka, ū ng'wenūyo shiigelile akomanyiwe wīnjiwe ū mu banhū bakwe. Nguno atamfunīgije ū SEEBA ī shakwinha shakwe ng'wikanza īlo lehelilwe. Ū munhū wa gīko akūgabūūcha wei ng'wenekīlī a makoye ga būkenaagūji wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ū ngeni ūyo akwikalaga mu bung'we ūlū nang'hwe ūtogwa kwīlya ī pasaka, shing'wigeleelilwe ashilondeele ī shilagīlo īsho shitūūlilwe ho, hamò na a kaīle kaaho. Mukūbiza na shilagīlo sha mbika īmò kū banhū bose, ū kū babisa nū kū baana byalwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilunde lya Moto",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwandīja ū lūshikū lwene līkīmīlījiwa ī lipandī lya kwikala, ī liheema lya būkaanīji, ilunde līkalīfīīkīja ī liheema lyenīlo. Alīyo ū kwandīja mhīndī kūshisha kū ntondo yaho dilū, ī lilunde lyabonagwa gītī moto a h'igūlya y'ipandī lya kwikala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jikabīta shikū ningī līkūbonagwa gīko; ī dilū lyabiza ilunde līkundīkīgije ho, alīyo ī mhīndī gwabiza gītī moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lilunde lyabizaga ūlū lyīnga a hiheema, a Baisilaeli baasambūlaga ī ng'hambī bandya lūgendo; hama hose hose aho līlaakalembeele ī lilunde lyenīlo, a Baisilaeli nabo baatūūlaga henaho ī ng'hambī yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli baasambūlaga ī ng'hambī yabo bandya lūgendo kūlwa shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA; na baatūūlaga ī ng'hambī yabo kūlwa shilagīlo shakwe. Pye ū ng'wikanza īlo lyalī līlembeelile ī lilunde a hiheema, nabo bikalaga a ha ng'hambī yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lilunde nūūlū lyūmala shikū ningī līlembeele a higūlya y'ipandī lya kwikala, a Baisilaeli baalī batīngaga a ha ng'hambī yenīyo, nguno baalī bashiigwile ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makanza gamò ī lilunde lyalembeelaga a higūlya y'ipandī lya kwikala shikū ngeehu dūhū. Būlī hene ūlū būtūūla ng'hambī bikalaga ho mu kūlondeela shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA, na bīnjaga ho ī ng'hamī yabo kūlwa shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo makanza gamò ī lilunde lyalembeelaga mapandī gangī kwandīja mhīndī, kūshisha ha ntondo dilū dūhū; ūlū lyūbūūka ī dilū nabo būbūūka. Ikanza lyose lyose aho lyūbūūkīla ī lilunde, ībize līīmi nūūlū būjikū; nabo bakwandya lūgengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lilunde lyabizaga ūlū lyūlembeela a higūlya y'ipandī lya kwikala ikanza lya shikū ibīlī, nūūlū ng'weji gūmò, nūūlū ng'waka ngima, a Baisilaeli bikalaga ho a ha ng'hambī yenīyo, baalī batasaamaga, alīyo bikalaga nzūgūlūmatū, ūlū lyūbūūka dūhū ī gīkī, nabo haho na haho bandya lūgendo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'hambī yabo baatūūlaga kūlwa shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA, hama nū kwīsambūla ī ng'hambī yabo na kwandya lūgendo, bīītaga gīko kūlwa shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA. Baalī bashiigwile ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA, īsho walī wabinha mu nzīla ya ng'wa Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
